flowchart TD
    A[Trained model] --> B{Task}
    B -- Classification --> C[Confusion matrix]
    C --> D[Precision, recall, F1, ROC-AUC, PR-AUC]
    B -- Regression --> E[RMSE, MAE, R2]
    B -- Ranking --> F[NDCG, MAP, recall@k]
    B -- Generation --> G[Human eval, BLEU, faithfulness]
    D --> H[Slice by segment]
    E --> H
    F --> H
    G --> H
    H --> I{Hidden failure in a slice?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Fix data or model]
    I -- No --> K[Offline gate passed]
    K --> L[Online A/B test on real metric]
